WEBVTT

00:01:29.687 --> 00:01:32.091
Karkalecat jane vetem nje hap 
ne jeten e tij.

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.703
Destinacioni i tij final eshte,

00:01:34.703 --> 00:01:36.650
flamingo i madh.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:39.675
Shiriti mund te riprodhohet 
vetem ne nje flamingo,

00:01:39.675 --> 00:01:42.964
per te arritur aty, ai duhet te manipuloje
karkalecin mbartes

00:01:42.964 --> 00:01:46.055
qe te formoje keto mizeri 
te ngjyrosura te dukshme

00:01:46.055 --> 00:01:48.772
qe jane me te lehta 
te vihen re nga nje flamingo

00:01:48.772 --> 00:01:50.331
dhe te gelltiten,

00:01:50.331 --> 00:01:53.263
dhe ky eshte sekreti 
i mizerive te Artemias.

00:01:53.263 --> 00:01:55.426
Ato nuk jane te shoqerueshme 
me vullnetin e tyre,

00:01:55.426 --> 00:01:57.502
por sepse ato po kontrollohen.

00:01:57.502 --> 00:01:59.196
Nuk eshte siguria ne shumice.

00:01:59.196 --> 00:02:01.055
Eshte ne fakt komplet e kunderta.